    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`cronServer` is the local cron server module for the `startio` application."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this module for local scheduled-job server activation, node composition, and runtime topology. Cron capability behavior belongs in reusable cron modules."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Local cron settings should remain layered, observable, and safe to override."
    }
